%% seq_10b_org_join_request_resolution.mmd
%% Updated 2026-07-10 (verified).
%% Reader intent: Understand how org admins read pending memberships and approve or reject them.
%% Key boundary: Admin-side resolution only; requester eligibility and submission live in seq_10_org_join_request.mmd.
%% Reading mode: Low-level sequence. Open after org membership overview or after seq_10 submission flow.
%% Current caveat: Runtime truth is still membership-state based; pending request means organization_users row with status='pending'.

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Org Owner/Admin
    participant B as Browser (Svelte)
    participant C as Controller
    participant Q as Query
    participant Cmd as Command
    participant Entity as Domain Entity
    participant Repo as Repository
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over Admin, DB: === VIEW PENDING MEMBERSHIPS ===
    Admin->>B: Open pending requests
    B->>C: GET /organizations/:id/members/pending
    C->>Q: GetPendingRequestsQuery.execute(dto)
    Q->>Repo: findPendingMembers(orgId)
    Repo->>DB: SELECT ou.*, u.* FROM organization_users
    Note over DB: WHERE organization_id=? AND status='pending'
    DB-->>Repo: Result set
    Repo-->>Q: Pending member entities
    Q-->>C: Pending DTO list
    C-->>B: Render pending page

    Note over Admin, DB: === APPROVE OR REJECT ===
    Admin->>B: Click Approve / Reject
    B->>C: POST /organizations/:id/members/process-request/:userId
    Note over B: body: { action: 'approve' | 'reject' }
    C->>Cmd: ProcessJoinRequestCommand.execute(dto)
    Cmd->>Repo: findPendingMembership(orgId, userId)
    Repo->>DB: SELECT organization_users
    Note over DB: WHERE organization_id=? AND user_id=? AND status='pending'
    DB-->>Repo: Pending row
    Repo-->>Cmd: Membership entity

    alt approve
        Cmd->>Entity: membership.approve(processedBy=admin.id)
        Cmd->>Repo: save(membershipEntity)
        Repo->>DB: UPDATE organization_users
        Note over DB: SET status='approved', processed_by=admin.id
    else reject
        Cmd->>Entity: membership.reject(processedBy=admin.id)
        Cmd->>Repo: save(membershipEntity)
        Repo->>DB: UPDATE organization_users
        Note over DB: SET status='rejected', processed_by=admin.id
    end

    Cmd-->>C: OK
    C-->>B: Redirect back
